Error [E0748]: `-[via n]>` on `invoke` names a parameter that isn't a callback
  --> effect_via_non_callback_param_is_e0748.jet:2:25
    |
  2 | fn invoke(n: Int) -[via n]> { print("{n}") }
    |                         ^
 Why: `n` has type `Int`, not a function type with an effect row
 Fix: Point `via` at a function parameter, or remove the `via` annotation
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0748
